{"url": "https://x.com/gohooper/status/2101164679099744523", "id": "2101164679099744523", "text": "New app: Kindling \u2192 https://mykindling.app\n\nIgnite the habit. Keep the flame.\nA calm daily habit tracker \u2014 streaks, 365 quotes, Focus puzzles, starter packs. No login needed. Just igniting the flame of good habits, that lead to a better quality of life.\n\nMy Grok Bot (Kindling App) changed how I ship creative.\nIt cut our launch reels end to end: live UI from the app, bold captions, phone-framed Habit packs (Kindness \u2192 Mind), side watermarks, iterated until the cut landed.\n\nBot template: https://x.ai/bot/fvTls162MvFivomK3REQf\n\n@Grok @Bot", "raw_text": {"text": "New app: Kindling \u2192 https://t.co/4tFaqmb783\n\nIgnite the habit. Keep the flame.\nA calm daily habit tracker \u2014 streaks, 365 quotes, Focus puzzles, starter packs. No login needed. Just igniting the flame of good habits, that lead to a better quality of life.\n\nMy Grok Bot (Kindling App) changed how I ship creative.\nIt cut our launch reels end to end: live UI from the app, bold captions, phone-framed Habit packs (Kindness \u2192 Mind), side watermarks, iterated until the cut landed.\n\nBot template: https://t.co/viRvhp7zUs\n\n@Grok @Bot", "display_text_range": [0, 527], "facets": [{"type": "url", "indices": [20, 43], "original": "https://t.co/4tFaqmb783", "replacement": "https://mykindling.app", "display": "mykindling.app"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [289, 312], "id": "2101164616545923072", "display": "pic.x.com/sfya6iTkNm", "original": "https://t.co/sfya6iTkNm", "replacement": "https://x.com/gohooper/status/2101164679099744523/video/1"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [289, 312], "id": "2101164643041280000", "display": "pic.x.com/sfya6iTkNm", "original": "https://t.co/sfya6iTkNm", "replacement": "https://x.com/gohooper/status/2101164679099744523/video/1"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [492, 515], "original": "https://t.co/viRvhp7zUs", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/fvTls162MvFi